    "question": "Review the proposed removal of the runtime configuration check before the query-cache lookup. Explain the visible ordering change and propose a cache-hit regression case.",
    "version": "",
    "context": "# Proposed patch for static review only; not applied or executed.\n--- a/triage_desk/hosted_embeddings.py\n+++ b/triage_desk/hosted_embeddings.py\n@@ -1,16 +1,15 @@\n     def embed_query(self, question: str) -> np.ndarray:\n         if not isinstance(question, str) or not question.strip():\n             raise ValueError(\"Embedding query must be nonempty text\")\n-        self._runtime_key()  # A changed endpoint must not reuse old query vectors.\n         identity = hashlib.sha256(question.encode()).hexdigest()\n         with self._query_lock:\n             if identity in self._query_cache:\n                 self._query_cache.move_to_end(identity)\n                 return self._query_cache[identity].copy()\n         value = self._request([question], \"query\")[0]\n         with self._query_lock:\n             self._query_cache[identity] = value.copy()\n             self._query_cache.move_to_end(identity)\n             while len(self._query_cache) > QUERY_CACHE_SIZE:\n                 self._query_cache.popitem(last=False)\n         return value.copy()\n",
    "use_case": "change_review"
  },
